# Configuração Manual do RabbitMQ

## Pré-requisitos

Acessar o pod/container do RabbitMQ:

```bash
kubectl exec -it <rabbitmq-pod> -- bash
```

ou

```bash
docker exec -it <rabbitmq-container> bash
```

## Criação das Exchanges

```bash
rabbitmqadmin --username=admin --password=admin declare exchange --name fcg.user.created-exchange --type direct --durable true
```

```bash
rabbitmqadmin --username=admin --password=admin declare exchange --name fcg.order.placed-exchange --type direct --durable true
```

```bash
rabbitmqadmin --username=admin --password=admin declare exchange --name fcg.payment.processed-exchange --type direct --durable true
```

## Criação das Filas

```bash
rabbitmqadmin --username=admin --password=admin declare queue --name fcg.user.created-queue --durable true
```

```bash
rabbitmqadmin --username=admin --password=admin declare queue --name fcg.order.placed-queue --durable true
```

```bash
rabbitmqadmin --username=admin --password=admin declare queue --name fcg.payment.processed-queue --durable true
```

## Criação dos Bindings

```bash
rabbitmqadmin --username=admin --password=admin declare binding --source fcg.user.created-exchange --destination-type queue --destination fcg.user.created-queue --routing-key fcg.user.created
```

```bash
rabbitmqadmin --username=admin --password=admin declare binding --source fcg.order.placed-exchange --destination-type queue --destination fcg.order.placed-queue --routing-key fcg.order.placed
```

```bash
rabbitmqadmin --username=admin --password=admin declare binding --source fcg.payment.processed-exchange --destination-type queue --destination fcg.payment.processed-queue --routing-key fcg.payment.processed
```

## Validação

Listar exchanges:

```bash
rabbitmqadmin --username=admin --password=admin list exchanges
```

Listar filas:

```bash
rabbitmqadmin --username=admin --password=admin list queues
```

Listar bindings:

```bash
rabbitmqadmin --username=admin --password=admin list bindings
```

## Remoção (Opcional)

### Remover Filas

```bash
rabbitmqadmin --username=admin --password=admin delete queue --name fcg.user.created-queue
```

```bash
rabbitmqadmin --username=admin --password=admin delete queue --name fcg.order.placed-queue
```

```bash
rabbitmqadmin --username=admin --password=admin delete queue --name fcg.payment.processed-queue
```

### Remover Exchanges

```bash
rabbitmqadmin --username=admin --password=admin delete exchange --name fcg.user.created-exchange
```

```bash
rabbitmqadmin --username=admin --password=admin delete exchange --name fcg.order.placed-exchange
```

```bash
rabbitmqadmin --username=admin --password=admin delete exchange --name fcg.payment.processed-exchange
```
